## Null Browser Brand
##
## Null Browser must be treated as a brand.
##
## They cannot be:
## - Transliterated.
## - Translated.
##
## Declension should be avoided where possible, leaving the original
## brand unaltered in prominent UI positions.
##
## For further details, consult:
## https://mozilla-l10n.github.io/styleguides/mozilla_general/#brands-copyright-and-trademark

-brand-shorter-name = Null
-brand-short-name = Null Browser
-brand-shortcut-name = Null Browser
-brand-full-name = Null Browser
-brand-product-name = Null Browser
-vendor-short-name = Null Browser
trademarkInfo = { " " }
